#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/extension-traits/should-i-define-an-extension-trait.md:6
msgid "Should I Define An Extension Trait?"
msgstr ""

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/extension-traits/should-i-define-an-extension-trait.md:8
msgid ""
"In what scenarios should you prefer an extension trait over a free function?"
msgstr ""

